<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0483_T06_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Vermilion Port is Kanto’s seaside\ngateway.\rFancy cruise ships from all over dock\nhere. I just watch. I can’t afford it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0483_T06_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My homie gettin’ the land ready for\nconstruction.\rBut I ain’t got the bread to start.\nBeen “gettin’ ready” for eight years.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0483_T06_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">MACHOP: Guooh gogogoh!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0483_T06_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There’s eight Blocks in Kanto.\rThat big buildin’ is Vermilion’s Block.\nThe Boss a army vet. He LOUD.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0483_T06_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Skilled Hustlers pull up in Kanto.\nThe Block Bosses EXTRA strong here.\rKanto don’t play.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0483_T06_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You collectin’ Kanto Block Chains?\rKanto Hustlers TOUGH, right?\nWe raised on hard knocks.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0483_T06_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I bet you run all the Kanto Blocks\nsoon.\rLmk when you got all eight Chains. I\ngot a surprise. It’s legit.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0483_T06_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">CONGRATS! You got ALL the Kanto\nChains!\rYour neck gotta be tired. Here’s a\nreward for the grind.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0483_T06_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A Drum Mag is a powerful item that\nraise a move’s top PP to the max.\fIt can change how you scrap!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0483_T06_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A Drum Mag is a powerful item that\nraise a move’s top PP to the max.\fIt can change how you scrap!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0483_T06_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Vermilion City\nSunsets and Sailors</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0483_T06_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Vermilion City Block\nBoss: Lt. Surge\fThe Lightning American. Loud.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0483_T06_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Pokémon Fan Club\nAll Homie Fans Welcome!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0483_T06_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Vermilion Port Entrance</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0483_T06_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Eusine: That was SO close!\nI tried to AMBUSH it here...\rBut it ran on WATER...\nI can’t do that. I tried. I sank.\rStill, I see a pattern now.\fSUICUNE LIKE WATER!\fThat mean...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0483_T06_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My bad, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}! I gotta go!\nSUICUNE waits for no man!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0483_T06_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo! My name is Steven.\fThe Kingpin from Hoenn.\rHave we met...before?\rCan’t be. All the Hustlers I scrapped\nlook the same. I’m a rock guy. Faces is\fhard.\rEspecially the ones who gave me tough\nscraps...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0483_T06_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Steven: By the way, you heard of\na homie called LATIAS?\rI’m lookin’ into why LATIAS,\na homie from Hoenn, decided to\fleave Hoenn and come here.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0483_T06_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Steven: By the way, you heard of\na homie called LATIOS?\rI’m lookin’ into why LATIOS,\na homie from Hoenn, decided to\fleave Hoenn and come here.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0483_T06_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">LATIAS got a lot to do with\nthe Soul Dew, a gem-lookin’ Orb.\rSince LATIAS in Kanto now,\nit’s safe to say\fthis got to do with the Soul Dew.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0483_T06_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">LATIOS got a lot to do with\nthe Soul Dew, a gem-lookin’ Orb.\rSince LATIOS in Kanto now,\nit’s safe to say\fthis got to do with the Soul Dew.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0483_T06_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">LATIAS travel MAD far.\rIt’s hard to find without a tracker. Or\na lotta free time.\rBut every Hustler gon’ be drawn to it,\nright?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0483_T06_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">LATIOS travel MAD far.\rIt’s hard to find without a tracker. Or\na lotta free time.\rBut every Hustler gon’ be drawn to it,\nright?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0483_T06_00023" index="23">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Steven: I gotta go. May our paths\ncross again. I’ll be lookin’ at rocks.\r</language>
	</row>
</body>
